                    "content": "```kotlin\nimport java.util.Scanner\n\nfun main() {\n    val sc = Scanner(System.`in`)\n    var n = sc.nextInt()\n    var m = sc.nextInt()\n    if (m > n) { val t = n; n = m; m = t }\n    val full = (1 shl m) - 1\n    val size = 1 shl m\n    val INF = Int.MAX_VALUE / 2\n\n    fun spread(s: Int): Int = ((s shl 1) or (s shr 1) or s) and full\n\n    var dp = Array(size) { IntArray(size) { INF } }\n    for (s in 0..full) {\n        val c = spread(s)\n        val cost = Integer.bitCount(s)\n        if (cost < dp[s][c]) dp[s][c] = cost\n    }\n\n    for (row in 1 until n) {\n        val ndp = Array(size) { IntArray(size) { INF } }\n        for (s in 0..full) {\n            for (cov in 0..full) {\n                val cur = dp[s][cov]\n                if (cur >= INF) continue\n                for (s2 in 0..full) {\n                    if ((cov or s2) != full) continue\n                    val ncov = spread(s2) or s\n                    val nc = cur + Integer.bitCount(s2)\n                    if (nc < ndp[s2][ncov]) ndp[s2][ncov] = nc\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        dp = ndp\n    }\n\n    var best = INF\n    for (s in 0..full) {\n        if (dp[s][full] < best) best = dp[s][full]\n    }\n    println(n * m - best)\n}\n```",
